  "details": "I've found that turning comfort turning off is uncomfortable; however, the space turn feature of OpenVR-AdvancedSettings (which locks the yaw of a selected controller and rotates the world around you instead) to be quite comfortable and a good way to precisely turn. It's also extremely useful for redirected locomotion. Please consider including a feature like this in the base VRChat application.\n\n個人的にはComfort turningを無効化した回転で酔うけど、OpenVR-AdvancedSettingsのSpace turn機能（コントローラーの向きを固定してワールドを回転させる機能）を快適で便利な回転方式に感じています。無限歩きなどにもとても便利です。こういう機能をVRChatそのものに導入することを検討してください。",
